{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf4bThis is the Demo to Ultimate Lemon Basket!\ud83c\udf4b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It features the first 15 levels that will appear in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The final game will have over 150 Levels, as well as more music, worlds and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf4bRun with the lemon, Keep it in the basket!!\ud83c\udf4b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc1Get to the Flag!!\ud83c\udfc1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude45\u200d\u2642\ufe0fDon't let the lemon hit the floor!!\ud83d\ude45\u200d\u2640\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaeIt's a 2D platformer!!\ud83c\udfae</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features of the demo:\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 different and funny mechanics!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leaderboards for Each Level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lot of strategic ways to get faster and faster times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A really goofy soundtrack by the On Time Great Alan Worm</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More about ultimate Lemon basket:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kind of funny that you can just put the word ultimate In front of anything and it suddenly becomes a sport.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ultimate Wooden Hammer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ultimate Cold Brew Coffee\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ultimate Industrial Strength Glue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anyway that's the inspiration for this game, not making a sport per say, but taking arbitrary materials and turning them in games. Does that make sense? Like lemons are sort of whatever right? I'm luke-warm on lemons. but now I've spent the last 6 months fretting about the exact shape of lemon and it's been really fun.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf4bMaybe you <strong><i><u>to</u></i>\u00a0</strong>could come to understand the lemon \ud83c\udf4b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865170?t=1752605541","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865170?t=1752605541","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865170/bb50996dd86fb88055270d13dafcf57378817b0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752605541","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865170/bb50996dd86fb88055270d13dafcf57378817b0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752605541","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf4bThis is the Demo to Ultimate Lemon Basket!\ud83c\udf4b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It features the first 15 levels that will appear in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The final game will have over 150 Levels, as well as more music, worlds and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf4bRun with the lemon, Keep it in the basket!!\ud83c\udf4b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc1Get to the Flag!!\ud83c\u